# Combat

Canonical: `_documentation/COMBAT_README.md` (not older “planning phase” notes in STATUS.md).

- Start: `SignalBus.combat_started(enemy_group, party_slots, facing)`
- End: **only** `CombatManager` emits `combat_ended`
- Actions: UI → `player_action_selected` / `TargetSelectionManager` pending ability → CombatManager
- Targets: `SINGLE_ENEMY|SINGLE_ALLY|ALL_ENEMY|ALL_ALLY|SELF`
- Snapshot stats into combatants at battle start; don’t mutate live exploration resources mid-resolve without going through CombatManager
- Row rules: front melee-exposed; back protected / melee restricted — see `BATTLES.md`
- Formulas live in `Scripts/Combat/` (`CombatMath`, `CombatTargeting`, `AbilityInfo`, `Combatant`, `ActiveEffect`): static, typed, no SignalBus/logging. Read those instead of CombatManager; change a formula there and update `tests/combat/`. CombatManager only injects state (guards, tuning exports) and logs.
